d UGC mit Marken weltweit — von aufstrebenden Indie-Launches bis zu etablierten Namen, die einen sanfteren, menschlicheren Blickwinkel suchen."],"categories":["Lifestyle & Zuhause","Reviews & Unboxings","Fashion & Accessoires","Familie & Wellness"],"stats":[{"num":"25","accentSuffix":"+","label":"Marken-Kooperationen"},{"num":"3","accentSuffix":"×","label":"Sprachen"},{"num":"100","accentSuffix":"%","label":"Authentisch"}]},"brands":{"eyebrowNum":"04","eyebrowLabel":"Vertraut von","title":"Marken, mit denen ich *zusammengearbeitet* habe.","intro":"Klick auf ein Logo, um die Kampagne auf Instagram & TikTok zu sehen","items":[{"corner":"01 · IG","name":"Lifestyle-*Marke*","category":"Tägliches Ritual","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWlfNS-CH5S/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"02 · IG","name":"Home-*Care*","category":"Familie & Zuhause","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWO2bTTiFfF/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"03 · IG","name":"Lifestyle-*Label*","category":"Alltags-Essentials","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DPeEtVCCLJL/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"04 · IG","name":"Fashion-*Marke*","category":"Fashion & Style","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DNVm30Bs7n4/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"05 · IG","name":"Wellness-*Haus*","category":"Self-Care-Review","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7bEPUstLHS/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"06 · IG","name":"Produkt-*Launch*","category":"Unboxing & Review","link":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DWipHTRiHh_/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"07 · TT","name":"Fashion-*Edit*","category":"TikTok-Kampagne","link":"https://vm.tiktok.com/ZNRXNyguD/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"08 · TT","name":"Morgen-*Routine*","category":"TikTok-Review","link":"https://vm.tiktok.com/ZNRXNgr2V/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"09 · TT","name":"Lifestyle-*Retail*","category":"In-Store-Haul","link":"https://vm.tiktok.com/ZNRXN4YGE/","isOpenSlot":false},{"corner":"10 · Frei","name":"+ Deine *Marke*","category":"Kontakt aufnehmen","link":"#contact","isOpenSlot":true}]},"services":{"eyebrowNum":"05","eyebrowLabel":"Leistungen & Preise","title":"Wähl, wie wir *deine Geschichte erzählen*.","intro":"Individuelle Pakete & langfristige Partnerschaften auf Anfrage","items":[{"number":"001","tag":"Instagram","name":"IG *Stories*","desc":"3–5 Instagram-Story-Kacheln, eingebettet in meinen täglichen Content für authentische Sichtbarkeit.","currency":"€","price":"70","variant":"regular"},{"number":"002","tag":"Am beliebtesten","name":"Reels *+* Stories","desc":"Ein Feed-Reel plus 3–5 begleitende Story-Frames. Bezahlte Promotion via Code auf Anfrage.","currency":"€","price":"150","variant":"featured"},{"number":"003","tag":"Instagram","name":"IG Reel */* Post","desc":"Reel oder Post mit Markenlink in der Caption, erstellt nach deinem Briefing und vor Veröffentlichung freigegeben.","currency":"€","price":"100","variant":"regular"},{"number":"004","tag":"UGC","name":"*UGC* Single","desc":"Ein UGC-Video bis zu 30 Sekunden — roh geliefert, bereit für deine Kanäle. Kein Posting auf meinem Profil.","currency":"€","price":"90","variant":"regular"},{"number":"005","tag":"Top-Preis-Leistung","name":"*UGC* Bundle","desc":"Drei UGC-Videos, kein Posting. Bestes Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis für Performance-Creative & Multi-Platform-Testing.","currency":"€","price":"230","variant":"regular"},{"number":"006","tag":"Individuell","name":"Langfristige *Partnerschaft*","desc":"Mehrmonatige Brand-Ambassador-Rolle, Whitelisting, Nutzungsrechte & Exklusivität — individuelles Angebot nach deinem Bedarf.","currency":"","price":"Sprich mich an","variant":"dashed"}],"note":"Alle Preise verstehen sich zzgl. MwSt. Whitelisting, Nutzungsrechte und Exklusivität auf Anfrage — lass uns über deine Kampagne sprechen."},"videos":{"eyebrowNum":"02","eyebrowLabel":"Ausgewählte Arbeiten","title":"Reels in *Bewegung*."},"gallery":{"eyebrowNum":"03","eyebrowLabel":"Fotografie","title":"Stills, *sanft beleuchtet*."},"contact":{"eyebrow":"06 · Kontakt aufnehmen","title":"Lass uns etwas\n*Sanftes* schaffen.","subtitle":"Erzähl mir von deiner Marke, deinem Produkt und dem Gefühl, das bei den Menschen bleiben soll — ich melde mich innerhalb von 48 Stunden.","emailLabel":"Schreib mir","email":"nadii.tsys@gmail.com","socials":[{"platform":"Instagram","handle":"@naditsys","url":"https://www.instagram.com/naditsys/"},{"platform":"TikTok","handle":"@nadii.tsys","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@nadii.tsys"}],"metaBasedInLabel":"Ansässig in","metaBasedInValue":"Warschau, Polen","metaLanguagesLabel":"Sprachen","metaLanguagesValue":"EN · UA · PL","metaReplyLabel":"Antwortzeit","metaReplyValue":"Innerhalb von 48 Std."},"footer":{"logo":"Nadia Tsys ✦","copyright":"© 2026 · Media Kit · Warschau","tagline":"Mit Sorgfalt gestaltet"}}')
